This extension adds The Last of Us Part I modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]Epic[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]
[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "build", a file with the ".pak" extension and a file with the ".bin" extension.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "bin", a file with the ".pak" extension and a file with the ".bin" extension to the "build\pc\main" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file with the ".pak" extension to the "build\pc\main" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "build" to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "USR-DATA" to the "USER_HOME\Saved Games\The Last of Us Part I\users\USERID_FOLDER\savedata" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a "screeninfo.cfg" file to the "USER_HOME\Saved Games\The Last of Us Part I\users\USERID_FOLDER" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "UnPSARC.exe" to the "build\pc\main" folder.[/*]
[*]Archives with a FOMOD installer (a "fomod" folder with ModuleConfig.xml) are handed to Vortex's built-in FOMOD installer instead.[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

